<title>THAILAND: Tanayong Q2 net profit up slightly.</title>
<headline>Tanayong Q2 net profit up slightly.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for the second quarter ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>					 Second quarter</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		   0.50   vs	 0.50</p>
<p>    Net			  154.33   vs	152.37</p>
<p>					   Six months</p>
